1Cfa__reportBtn"><span class="rbx-material-icon" aria-hidden="true" translate="no" style="font-size:calc(16px * var(--rbx-material-scale, 1.12));width:16px;height:16px;font-variation-settings:&#x27;FILL&#x27; var(--rbx-material-fill, 0), &#x27;wght&#x27; var(--rbx-material-wght, 400), &#x27;GRAD&#x27; var(--rbx-material-grad, -25), &#x27;opsz&#x27; 16">flag</span><span>Report</span></button></div></div><div class="page-module__t-1Cfa__descriptionBody "><div class="MarkdownRenderer-module__usNEga__markdown page-module__t-1Cfa__scriptDescriptionMarkdown"><p>A free to use Roblox Huss Valley script, giving you features to help you as runner &amp; catcher</p><p>The survival functions with auto runner enabled does a decent job at path finding to the other side, getting you through without being cought </p><p>The game can be pretty unpredictable, laggy and what not which will still lead to getting cought here and there -you can adjust the tuning of prediction to see what works best for you</p><p>As a catcher, you can auto hunt which will target players with the highest success rate of you actually getting them </p><p>Both runners &amp; catchers get multiplying speed boost</p><p>Enabling danger visualizer, creates a circle under you, which expands when safe and shrinks, turning red to signal danager and its time to goo</p></div></div></div><hr class="page-module__t-1Cfa__sectionDivider"/><div class="page-module__t-1Cfa__codeSection"><div class="CodeBlock-module__XgvW-q__container"><div class="CodeBlock-module__XgvW-q__headerRow"><div class="page-module__t-1Cfa__scriptTitleRow"><h2 class="page-module__t-1Cfa__sectionTitle">Script</h2></div><div class="CodeBlock-module__XgvW-q__headerRight"><div class="SocialLinkButtons-module__O4IeDq__socialBtnRow"><a href="https://discord.gg/6TXCR4wuJm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="SocialLinkButtons-module__O4IeDq__socialBtn SocialLinkButtons-module__O4IeDq__socialBtnDiscord" data-tooltip="discord.gg/6TXCR4wuJm"